y","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"NC State hires Jatavis Sanders as GM under Philip Rivers","description":"NC State has hired Jatavis Sanders as its general manager under new coach Philip Rivers, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T16:33:25.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502157/nc-state-hires-jatavis-sanders-gm-philip-rivers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"ACC suspends Louisville LB Clark, UNC DB Smith over postgame brawl","description":"The ACC has suspended Louisville LB Stanquan Clark and North Carolina DB Greg Smith III, while also issuing fines and public reprimands to both schools in the wake of Saturday's postgame brawl.","published":"2026-11-16T16:19:01.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502075/louisville-lb-clark-unc-db-smith-suspended-postgame-brawl","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan top WR JJ Buchanan (shoulder) likely out for season","description":"Michigan's leading receiver JJ Buchanan will likely miss the rest of the season after he sustained a shoulder injury in Saturday's loss at No. 16 Oregon.","published":"2026-11-16T16:30:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50502065/michigan-top-wr-jj-buchanan-shoulder-likely-season","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 college football coaching carousel: Tracking every open job","description":"As the carousel spins, we'll keep you updated with all the comings and goings.","published":"2026-11-16T16:00:31.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50358611/2026-cfb-coaching-carousel-firings-hirings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"UTEP fires head coach Scotty Walden following 8th straight loss","description":"The UTEP Miners, just 1-9 this season and mired in an eight-game losing streak, have fired head coach Scotty Walden, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-16T15:13:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50501672/utep-1-9-season-fires-coach-walden-8th-straight-loss","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Where is 'College GameDay'? 2026 schedule, locations, recaps","description":"What is the \"College GameDay\" schedule? Find out more about where the program will be each week of the 2026 college football season.","published":"2026-11-16T14:25:23.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49783645/where-college-gameday-2026-schedule-locations-recaps","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Top 25 betting lines: UGA big faves over Gamecocks, Vols slim favorites vs. LSU","description":"This week's odds and FPI predictions for South Carolina-Georgia, Tennessee-LSU and more.","published":"2026-11-16T13:48:40.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50498153/2026-college-football-week-12-top-25-betting-lines-odds","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026-27 Week 11 College Football Playoff, bowl projections","description":"Our bowl gurus take a look at how the postseason picture shifted after Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:28:16.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50473016/2026-week-11-college-football-playoff-bowl-projections","type":"Story","byline":"Kyle Bonagura and Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football takeaways: Lasting impressions from Week 11","description":"Our college football experts break down the most important things they saw in Week 11.","published":"2026-11-16T12:21:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/mondaytakeaways111626/2026-college-football-takeaways-week-11","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079518/jaylen-mcclain","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaylen_McClain"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jaylen McClain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaylen_McClain","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:23Z","intro":"Jaylen McClain (born June 24, 2006) is an American football safety for the Ohio State Buckeyes.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"McClain attended high school at Seton Hall Preparatory School located in Essex County, New Jersey. During his junior season, he notched 83 tackles along with two interception, while also scoring an offensive touchdown. Coming out of high school, McClain was rated as a four-star recruit, the 22nd overall safety, and the 243 overall player in the class of 2024, where he committed to play college football for the Ohio State Buckeyes over offers from other schools such as Georgia, Michigan, Michigan State, Notre Dame, Oregon, Rutgers, Penn State, Stanford, Tennessee, and USC."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"During his true freshman season in 2024, he played in all 15 games, notching 15 tackles. Heading into the 2025 season, McClain competed with Malik Hartford for a starting spot in the Buckeyes secondary. Ultimately, he would beat out Hartford, and become the team's starting safety besides Caleb Downs. In week one of the 2025 season, McClain notched eight tackles in a victory over the #1 ranked Texas Longhorns. In week three, he notched a pass deflection, in a 37-9 victory over Ohio."}]}}